# Frontend build-time configuration.
#
# Local dev: leave this UNSET — Vite proxies /api to http://localhost:8000.
#
# Production (Vercel/Netlify): set VITE_API_BASE to your deployed backend origin,
# with NO trailing slash and NO /api suffix. Example:
# VITE_API_BASE=https://urj-backend.onrender.com
